# Wave W17-N (Route 112): fume turf — warm slope grass under the chimney, green warmed at the edges with the mountain’s ash-dust already flecking it grey (design: calm speckled grass on warm volcanic foothills, ash-grey creeping in). Route 112’s own ground — warmer than Route 110’s under-way meadow, and the ash flecks announce the summit above.
